    "hint_texts": "Develop new tests to validate the behavior of the get_group_by_cols method added to ExpressionWrapper. Create one test case to confirm that wrapping a constant expression results in an empty list for group by columns, and another test case to verify that a non-constant expression properly returns its grouping column. The tests should be added to the ExpressionWrapperTests section in tests/expressions/tests.py and cover the edge cases indicated by the problem statement.",
    "entrypoint": "File: tests/expressions/tests.py. Add the new test cases within a test class (e.g., ExpressionWrapperTests) that checks the output of get_group_by_cols when provided with both constant and non-constant expressions.",
